<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL SUBSIDIARY IN PLN 12 MLN DEAL.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL SUBSIDIARY IN PLN 12 MLN DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 77-percent-owned subsidiary of Polish construction firm Mostostal Zabrze SA, Zaklad Montazowo- Produkcyjny Kedzierzyn Sp.z o.o., has won a contract worth about 12 million zlotys, Mostostal said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Mostostal said in a statement that its work on the assembly of a chemical instalation would be completed by September 1998.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
